WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.365 --> 00:00:09.095
I'm gonna ask you a series of questions

00:00:10.745 --> 00:00:12.815
I want you to respond truthfully

00:00:14.505 --> 00:00:16.065
Have you ever hurt someone?

00:00:18.715 --> 00:00:19.215
Yes

00:00:19.215 --> 00:00:19.715
 

00:00:26.555 --> 00:00:29.035
Have you ever experienced anything you would consider

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:31.720
abnormal?

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:37.920
Yes..?

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.040
Last question!

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.980
Do you know what MUTANTS are?

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.840
Did you know baby rattle snakes

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:50.340
 

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.080
are more dangerous

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.120
than adult ones.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.205
They haven't learnt how to control how much venom they secrete.

00:00:56.205 --> 00:00:57.200
 

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:02.720
All of you

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:04.180
are dangerous.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.220
That's why you're here.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.160
What is this place?

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.520
This isn't a hospital

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:31.320
It's a haunted house!

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.260
You've been through a lot.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:50.440
Get some rest.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:52.300
*screaming*

